{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>22歲香港「網球一哥」黃澤林早前宣告結束半年情，隨即火速戀上新歡譚旻萱，因而捲入無縫交接爭議。即使男方親自開腔解畫，外界對這段發展神速的感情依然充滿好奇。昨日他毫不避忌地帶同女方出席長輩飯局，認愛後終於同框的畫面為這段關係帶來全新衝擊。</p>\n<h2>九巴後人雷禮權大晒黃澤林飯局合照</h2>\n<p>九巴後人雷禮權昨日在個人社交平台分享與好友聚餐大合照，令這對話題情侶認愛後終於同框曝光。相中可見黃澤林身穿淺藍色短袖T恤配深色長褲，面對鏡頭展露招牌燦爛笑容，而身旁的譚旻萱則穿上白色長袖上衣襯鬆身牛仔褲，臉帶微笑表情略顯拘謹。雷禮權在貼文寫上「Coleman came over for dinner」，直接公開兩人結伴出席長輩飯敍這項消息。</p>\n<h2>男主角親上網台交代無縫交接爭議</h2>\n<p>面對外界猛烈抨擊，黃澤林早前登上網台節目親自釐清換畫時間線。他堅稱在9月已經與舊愛分開，並強調「當時係佢提出分手，分手原因完全無關第三者介入」，力證自己並未出軌。他補充指出去到10月才與現任女友在乾淨情況下認識及了解，隨後才正式確立情侶關係。</p>\n<h2>譚旻萱9月搬入西貢新居引重疊疑雲</h2>\n<p>男方連番保證絕無劈腿，但眼尖網民翻查資料後揪出關鍵時間點。有人發現譚旻萱早於9月已經搬入西貢新居，甚至有傳該處正是兩人共築愛巢，這個搬家時間恰巧與舊戀情結束月份重疊。加上他與舊愛拍拖僅短短半年就火速散場，令大批網民持續在各大討論區發文深挖各項線索。</p>\n<h2>網民聚焦討論陳康堤前度極速換畫行為</h2>\n<p>兩人高調同框照片曝光後，各大討論區隨即湧現海量評論。有網民留言嘲諷「咁快就帶出嚟見長輩，真係好心急」、「時間線點計都係怪怪地」，質疑雙方發展進度過於急進。亦有部分人將注意力放在兩人外型配搭上，表示「其實佢哋身高外型都幾襯」、「後生仔女拍拖好正常」，雙方陣營在網上持續激烈交鋒。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410417498292_17630430156b0007c8be407.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410417498292_17630430156b0007c8be407.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：黃澤林IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410535268195_5298964226b0007c9c10b3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410535268195_5298964226b0007c9c10b3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：黃澤林IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410609666516_15540774796b0007ca8b039.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410609666516_15540774796b0007ca8b039.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：黃澤林IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410609666516_15540774796b0007ca8b039.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516410609666516_15540774796b0007ca8b039.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179406583387227910_21460113896aef45aa2f903.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"劉穎鏇 莊錠欣 Mandy和黃澤林早前公開戀情！（圖片來源：IG圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179406583387227910_21460113896aef45aa2f903.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Mandy和黃澤林早前公開戀情！（圖片來源：IG圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540003819406_1811854566ae8b4486de26.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳康堤 黃澤林 他明確指出這段關係告終完全不涉及第三者介入，並爆料表示：「其實係佢提出分手」。（圖片來源：IG圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540003819406_1811854566ae8b4486de26.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>他明確指出這段關係告終完全不涉及第三者介入，並爆料表示：「其實係佢提出分手」。（圖片來源：IG圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285113503099231_9482324906adcbcc022a81.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳康堤 黃澤林 陳康堤10月24日出席公開活動時，首度親口證實與黃澤林分手，正式宣布恢復單身。（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1 HK）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285113503099231_9482324906adcbcc022a81.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳康堤10月24日出席公開活動時，首度親口證實與黃澤林分手，正式宣布恢復單身。（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1 HK）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:04:02.275714+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1146,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:41:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:37:20.133226+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:57:23.805730+00:00","content_hash":"75d69fe38c93edab402ffd96993ba3477657f8cd1bcd2b8ee076ef83b380ba0c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}